OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Navy welcomes unmanned boat
OL,4,Asquadron
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Royal Navy has made a squadron
OL,7,Fformed entirely of autonomous boats
OL,8,Fofficially part of the fleet for the
OL,9,Ffirst time.
OL,11,FThe ceremony for the commissioning of
OL,12,Fthe 1st Autonomous Squadron took place
OL,13,Fat HMNB Portsmouth, featuring a
OL,14,Fdemonstration of the Kraken K3 Scout
OL,15,Fboats.
OL,17,FSenior officers say the new capability
OL,18,Fwill help defend the UK against rapidly
OL,19,Fchanging threats, as the Navy strives
OL,20,Fto create a fleet of both manned and
OL,21,Funmanned vessels.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
