OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Navy welcomes unmanned boat
OL,4,Asquadron
OL,5,
OL,6,FCapt Adam Ballard, deputy commander of
OL,7,Fthe surface flotilla, told the BBC:
OL,8,F"This is about a Navy that is truly
OL,9,Fhybrid, and so you take the benefits of
OL,10,Fboth types - the amazing capability and
OL,11,Fflexibility of these systems along with
OL,12,Fa carrier strike group."
